    "invariant": "Keep the required function intact through every required phase, including final release or reversal. Preserve hard resource, legality and non-damage constraints while considering alternatives.",
    "conditions": "Use only supplied available resources, supported properties and legal operations. Separate hard requirements from soft preferences. Consolidate the most plausible ordinary account early while keeping honest unknowns visible.",
