    "operation": "Start with routine fit rather than inventing a mechanism. Use received feedback to check whether a failure came from insufficient supported contribution, an illegal transition, a missed required phase or excessive burden. Preserve an ordinary construction when it fits; an available ordinary alternative may reduce burden without changing the required function.",
